<title>USA: Westwood Financial sets share buyback.</title>
<headline>Westwood Financial sets share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>WESTWOOD, N.J. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westwood Financial Corp said Monday it plans to buy back up to 64,000 common shares, or about 10 percent of its outstanding common shares, in a &quot;modified Dutch Auction.&quot;</p>
<p>The offer, which was to begin today, would allow shareholders to set a selling price of not greater than $15 and not less than $14 per share.</p>
<p>The company will then select a single per-share price that allows it to buy back up to 64,000 shares.</p>
<p>The tender offer is set to expire 1700 EST/2200 GMT on December 26.</p>
</text>
